  tutorsIntro:
    "IB Gram tutors cover the IB from PYP to the Diploma and both Cambridge and Pearson Edexcel IGCSE. Families in Nawabganj see a shortlist built on the subject, level, board and exam session your child is working towards, and each lesson runs live on video at an hour your household can hold to week after week.",

